            "review_text": "Sonya M\nBrisbane, Australia116 contributions\n0\nThought it would of been better\nJun 2024 • Family\nThought it would be nice, ordered our four meals, they got hubby’s wrong but we didn’t say anything, 10 mins later mine came out… 10 to 15mins later my son’s came out… waited for extra 30mins for our other son’s… I went and asked… they said soon (we had all finished for over 20mins)… sons steak came out cold… seriously cold!!!! I took it up and made staff touch it… colder then a penguins sooner cover!!!\nPity… we hoped this place would have been nice… disappointed ….\nRead more\nWritten June 24, 2024",
