            "review_text": "Denniz\n1 contribution\n0\nDisgusting place\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nI’ve never been to a restaurant/bar this bad. I ordered meat and got seafood then and I said I don’t eat seafood. After that they wouldn’t give me the food I ordered so me and my friends told them we were leaving because we wanted to eat together and not me watching them eat. They started to argue with us and told me I can watch them eat and I don’t have to pay for the food that I didn’t get. Bad service, bad attitude and bad atmosphere!!!!!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDon’t go there\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 22, 2024",
