            "review_title": "Review at Sky Zone Beer Garden Nguyễn Huệ",
            "review_text": "Travelman\nBangkok, Thailand91 contributions\n1\nSpare Rib a rip-off or the cook is shorting you.\nJan 2024 • Couples\nOk taking my wife to dinner top floor skyzone bar looked a nice place snd have eaten here many times previously with good value meal choices.\nNot overly full but lively crowd - attentive waiters taking orders from an enticing menu. The grilled pork ribs showed a good size rack of 6-7 ribs. 295,000 VND\n\nWhat arrived was an insulting joke! One and a half short ribs chopped into 9-10 small pieces of offcuts. I asked immediately and was told by the waiter Yes its nothing like the photo and that was all they had. As enclosed photo shows about a quarter of what was advertised and nothing like a medium size rack. Not counting the two pieces of boneless fat served the last time photo shows was was left 7 odd pieces of vastly different aged ribs and two meatless pieces of gristle…. If I was the manager I would be checking the cooks inventory compared to what you are buying him versus what might be going out the back door. It certainly is not being served to customers.\n\nRip off. Spoiler alert make sure you ask if the menu photos even closely represent what you will be served.\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
