            "review_text": "Pham L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam75 contributions\n0\nGood place for food and amazing service in town\nAug 2023 • Friends\nNgan, Tai and Van showed me truly excellent and professional customer service style during dinner at the restaurant with my colleagues today. We really appreciate your thoughtful care and service: The food is very delicious, suitable for both Vietnamese and foreigners. The restaurant's Vietnamese friend also showed us his professionalism in managing staff during the time we came here to have dinner and organize a colleague's birthday party. I will definitely recommend Sky Zone to my friends, colleagues and family who come here in the future. Thank you very much for the professionalism and dedication of the four friends: Viet, Tai Van and Ngan\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 30, 2023",
